post.description:
Creates an empty conversation. Nothing is sent to Claude until the first message. Every field is
optional: `model` and `effort` default to the server defaults and act as the defaults for each turn;
`system_prompt` is fixed for the whole conversation (the server default applies when it is omitted);
`title` defaults to the start of the first message.

The model and effort are checked against the token's restrictions. Creating a session does not count
towards the rate limit.

